  scriptedFlavorTexts:
  - The Draugr Wight flings his great-axe at {mc}.
  - The Draugr Wight tries to fling his great-axe again, but {mc} raises his shield
    to defend.
  - The Draugr Wight swings his great-axe at {mc}.
  - The Draugr Wight corners {mc} to hit him with his great-axe.
  - The Draugr Wight goes for {mc}'s ankles.
  - The Draugr Wight throws his great-axe from above, letting gravity take it down
    to {mc}.
